<h1>Methodology</h1>

<p class="site-lead">How A11y Intuition Lab (AIL) extends and retests the 2017 GOV.UK accessibility tool audit, what we changed compared with the original study, and how anyone can repeat the work.</p>

<p>This page summarises the method. The detailed, versioned record is the <a href="{{ wiki }}index.md">project wiki</a>: every decision is numbered (D-001, D-002 …) in the <a href="{{ wiki }}decisions.md">decision log</a>, and every change to GOV.UK material is listed under <a href="{{ wiki }}provenance.md">provenance</a>.</p>

